2026-05-14 00:16:53 [AutoTesting]             checkpoints += 1
2026-05-14 00:16:53 [AutoTesting]     
2026-05-14 00:16:53 [AutoTesting]         # Apply the main weight classification.
2026-05-14 00:16:53 [AutoTesting]         # This if/else is a key branch because it separates normal light packages
2026-05-14 00:16:53 [AutoTesting]         # from heavier packages.
