2026-05-14 00:21:26 [AutoTesting]     # - heavier deliveries are classified as heavy;
2026-05-14 00:21:26 [AutoTesting]     # - fragile deliveries over long distances require special handling;
2026-05-14 00:21:26 [AutoTesting]     # - routes with many checkpoints receive a long-route suffix.
2026-05-14 00:21:26 [AutoTesting]     
