2026-05-14 00:35:24 [AutoTesting]         """
2026-05-14 00:35:24 [AutoTesting]         Returns a simple classification for a delivery request.
2026-05-14 00:35:24 [AutoTesting]     
2026-05-14 00:35:24 [AutoTesting]         Rules:
2026-05-14 00:35:24 [AutoTesting]         - weight_kg must be >= 0
2026-05-14 00:35:24 [AutoTesting]         - distance_km must be >= 0
2026-05-14 00:35:24 [AutoTesting]         - fragile indicates whether the package needs extra care
2026-05-14 00:35:24 [AutoTesting]         - distance is analyzed through a small loop that counts 50 km checkpoints
2026-05-14 00:35:24 [AutoTesting]         """
2026-05-14 00:35:24 [AutoTesting]     
2026-05-14 00:35:24 [AutoTesting]         # Validate the basic input domain.
