2026-05-14 00:46:46 [AutoTesting]     # This function classifies a delivery request and returns a status string.
2026-05-14 00:46:46 [AutoTesting]     # It first validates that the numeric inputs are non-negative.
2026-05-14 00:46:46 [AutoTesting]     # Then it counts route checkpoints through a loop, using one checkpoint for
