2026-05-14 00:46:46 [AutoTesting]     # After validation and route analysis, it classifies the delivery:
2026-05-14 00:46:46 [AutoTesting]     # - light deliveries have weight up to 5 kg;
2026-05-14 00:46:46 [AutoTesting]     # - heavier deliveries are classified as heavy;
2026-05-14 00:46:46 [AutoTesting]     # - fragile deliveries over long distances require special handling;
2026-05-14 00:46:46 [AutoTesting]     # - routes with many checkpoints receive a long-route suffix.
2026-05-14 00:46:46 [AutoTesting]     
2026-05-14 00:46:46 [AutoTesting]     def classify_delivery(weight_kg: int, distance_km: int, fragile: bool) -> str:
2026-05-14 00:46:46 [AutoTesting]         """
2026-05-14 00:46:46 [AutoTesting]         Returns a simple classification for a delivery request.
2026-05-14 00:46:46 [AutoTesting]     
