2026-05-14 00:58:12 [AutoTesting]     def classify_delivery(weight_kg: int, distance_km: int, fragile: bool) -> str:
2026-05-14 00:58:12 [AutoTesting]         """
2026-05-14 00:58:12 [AutoTesting]         Returns a simple classification for a delivery request.
