2026-05-14 01:08:27 [AutoTesting]     # - heavier deliveries are classified as heavy;
2026-05-14 01:08:27 [AutoTesting]     # - fragile deliveries over long distances require special handling;
2026-05-14 01:08:27 [AutoTesting]     # - routes with many checkpoints receive a long-route suffix.
2026-05-14 01:08:27 [AutoTesting]     
2026-05-14 01:08:27 [AutoTesting]     def classify_delivery(weight_kg: int, distance_km: int, fragile: bool) -> str:
2026-05-14 01:08:27 [AutoTesting]         """
