2026-05-14 01:08:27 [AutoTesting]         - distance_km must be >= 0
2026-05-14 01:08:27 [AutoTesting]         - fragile indicates whether the package needs extra care
2026-05-14 01:08:27 [AutoTesting]         - distance is analyzed through a small loop that counts 50 km checkpoints
2026-05-14 01:08:27 [AutoTesting]         """
2026-05-14 01:08:27 [AutoTesting]     
2026-05-14 01:08:27 [AutoTesting]         # Validate the basic input domain.
